OL,3,GNEWSAChinese car giant to set up UK
OL,4,Aresearch centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Chinese car giant Chery Automobile
OL,7,Fwill open a new research centre in
OL,8,FBedfordshire later this year, as it
OL,9,Fbuilds up its presence in the UK.
OL,11,FThe Research and Development (R&D)
OL,12,FCentre of Excellence will be based at
OL,13,FUTAC Millbrook, a large testing
OL,14,Ffacility widely used by the motor
OL,15,Findustry and the Ministry of Defence.
OL,17,FThe move, described by the company as a
OL,18,F"major expansion" of its global R&D
OL,19,Ffootprint, comes as it is also
OL,20,Fexploring the possibility of building
OL,21,Fcars in this country.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
