OL,3,GNEWSAChinese car giant to set up UK
OL,4,Aresearch centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FGary Lan, the chief executive of Chery
OL,7,FInternational UK, said: "The
OL,8,Festablishment of our UK R&D Centre of
OL,9,FExcellence is the next step in our
OL,10,Flong-term plan for the UK."
